UFACTURE OR FULL-CURRENT TEST" (at 20 153 0) (effects (font (size 1.52 1.52)) (justify left top)) (uuid 329027fc-464b-5806-9787-2c5bcd24aeb1)) (text "1. One cell is one-sixth of the future 220 A RMS module: about 51.9 A peak with ideal sinusoidal sharing." (at 20 160 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid b50ab1b4-ef2e-593c-a905-824236cdb50f)) (text "2. QH1 / QL1 symbol exposes every package pad: 1 gate; 2,4,6 source; 3,5,7 drain. No separate Kelvin package pin." (at 20 165 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 70b9574f-2eac-5457-a260-f7fc3fd5805f)) (text "3. Gate return must take off at the source pad nearest the gate; copper geometry defines Kelvin performance." (at 20 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 32c10424-b379-59d7-b9a5-d58fabaf669e)) (text "4. Cold plate contacts the source-connected FET tops through insulating TIM. Driver circuitry is external." (at 20 175 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 23d57800-5c63-5fb2-826e-865d8a1d33d9)) (text "5. Port pads and driver pads are interface placeholders, not selected/rated connectors. RG values require driver tuning." (at 20 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid d800bff2-ad52-5e78-8fdb-ebbea6318110)) (text "6. Verify VDS overshoot, capacitance bias/ripple, current sharing, coolant conditions and completed routing before release." (at 20 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.16 1.16)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6bfede3f-e049-5161-9c91-189738ba1dc2)))